{
  "_comment": [
    "Resolved assets for MFI_JLG_CREDIT_UW (M6-01). JSON, not YAML: every value here carries an",
    "explicit type and every decimal is a quoted string, so YAML's scalar inference would add a",
    "second parser to the signing path and buy nothing.",
    "",
    "The numbers follow the RBI Master Direction on microfinance loans (2022) where it sets one \u2014",
    "the 300,000 household income ceiling and the 50% obligation cap are regulatory, not ours. The",
    "rest are a plausible lender's own limits and exist so the reference policy has something to",
    "evaluate against; a real deployment's parameter set is the lender's credit policy and comes",
    "from the registry's parameter tables (LLD 5.2), where a change to one is a new policy",
    "version with a new bundle hash.",
    "",
    "The two REGULATORY values are MFI_HH_ANNUAL_INCOME_MAX and MFI_HH_OBLIGATION_CAP_PCT. In the",
    "registry they carry source_ref and next_review_on and a CHECK enforces both (FR-GOV-005); a",
    "resolved asset file has nowhere to put them, which is why docs/COMPLIANCE.md holds the",
    "register and names the compliance owner who confirms each value."
  ],
